# Progressive Loading & Performance (CO-PERF-002)



Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Extends CO-PERF-001 / Sprint C



## Principle



Primary business entities render immediately. Secondary context loads progressively.



## Patterns



1. **My Deals** — Phase 1 `view=summary` · Phase 2 background enrich  

2. **Workspace bootstrap** — `GET /api/enterprise-deals/:id?include=siblings`  

3. **Tier-0 cache** — `src/lib/enterprise-tier0-cache` (products / lenders)  

4. **Lazy modules** — hidden / collapsed panels must not fetch until opened  

5. **Optimistic UI** — update UI first; persist async; merge without full reload  



## Do not regress



- CO-ARCH-005 Mission Control snapshots  

- CO-ARCH-007 one-lender-one-deal sibling SSOT  

- CAD-2026-001 / Opportunity provenance  



